# Mockup UI match (Oct 2026)

Concept screenshots in `docs/screenshots/` are the visual target (not live captures). Keep player renderers and `GridMockup.vue` aligned with them.

## Screenshots

| File | Focus |
| --- | --- |
| `mockup-domain-tiles.jpg` | Teal header lines; teal segmented level bars; nav = full teal top line + active teal pill |
| `mockup-detail-cards.jpg` | Centered title, circular close left; white segmented bars; connected choice rows; pill Reset |
| `mockup-freeform-compose.jpg` | Dial / countdown / QR on white plate; `Note \| Light` underline tabs; nav active = top teal bar |

## Implemented patterns

- **Nav (`ScreenRenderer.navButton` + `GridMockup`):** Hybrid of both mockups — continuous `NAV_LINE` + per-item top bar + teal pill when on. Idle icon/label = `Role.INK`; active = `KEY_ON_INK` on pill. CSS: `.nav .button .top-bar` / `.pill`.
- **Tabs (`FreeForm.tabsNode`):** Pipe-separated labels; teal underline under active; selection in `n.<id>.tab` via `StateLayout`. Helpers `tabStrip` / `tabLabel` call layout APIs through `scope.*`.
- **Segmented bars (`Controls.segmentedLevelBar`):** Detail cards (`CardRenderer.bar`) → fill `Role.INK`; domain tiles (`Tiles.entityTileLevelBar`) → fill `Role.ACCENT`, track `Role.TRACK`.
- **Choices:** Short lists (2–`FLOW_KEYS_SEGMENT_MAX`) → `choiceRow` / `flowKeys`; bind via `bindChoices`.
- **Tile header line (`Vars` `KEY_LINE`):** Off = `Role.ACCENT_SOFT`, on = pastel accent. Editor `.tile .line` uses `--rc-accent-soft`.
- **QR:** White rounded plate behind the code (`FreeForm.qrNode`).
- **Editor bindables:** Dial / countdown / QR + free-form blocks (timerkeys, todolist, events, mediabar, forecast, presence, led) in `AttributesPanel` / `nodes.ts`.

## Themes / CSS

Roles `accent_soft` and `key_on_ink` live in `Themes.kt` → `--rc-accent-soft` / `--rc-key-on-ink` via `editor/src/model/palette.ts` `themeVars`.

## Verify

```bash
./gradlew :server:detekt :server:test \
  --tests 'tech.shaffersoftworks.remotescreens.server.render.FreeFormTest' \
  --tests 'tech.shaffersoftworks.remotescreens.server.render.RenderTest'
```

`RenderTest` tile-line assertions expect `ACCENT_SOFT` when off, pastel when on.

## Gotchas

- Detekt: keep `tabsNode` ≤60 lines (extract helpers); break long `navButton` label lines.
- Compose DSL (`StateLayout` / `Row` / `Spacer`) must run on `scope` / inside an `RcScope` lambda — not bare on `DocContext`.
- Domain vs free-form nav mockups disagree slightly; prefer hybrid (pill + top accent), don’t drop either cue without an explicit design change.
